  (2553, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Black Diamond Ventures', 'Venture Fund', 'Pre-Seed, Seed, Series A, Series B, Series C, Growth', 'https://bdventures.com/', 'We invest in companies raising Series B and growth capital in our focus sectors – deep tech and biotech – including verticals in AI and ML, big data, materials science, and semiconductors. We invest in visionary founders offering proprietary tech/ product solutions designed for a large and quantifiable market within a B2B or B2B2C business model.', '', '', '', '450 N. Brand Blvd., Suite 600, Glendale, CA 91203, US', 'Us', 39.8283, -98.5795, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We invest in companies raising Series B and growth capital in our focus sectors – deep tech and biotech – including verticals in AI and ML, big data, materials science, and semiconductors. We invest in visionary founders offering proprietary tech/ product solutions designed for a large and quantifiable market within a B2B or B2B2C business model. Invests in: USA First cheque: $25,000 - $5,000,000', null),
