  (2619, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Calm/Storm Ventures', 'Venture Fund', 'Pre-Seed, Seed', 'https://www.calmstorm.vc/', 'We invest in the Digital Health & Wellbeing space. Particularly we focus on projects tackling taboo subjects that once were deemed too sensitive to discuss but that have huge potential markets. We believe in diversity and equal opportunities and support unrepresented minorities. 50% of our portfolio companies have diverse teams and every third CEO.', '', '', '', 'Frankenberggasse 13, Top 18, Wien, 1040, AT', 'Frankenberggasse 13', null, null, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We invest in the Digital Health & Wellbeing space. Particularly we focus on projects tackling taboo subjects that once were deemed too sensitive to discuss but that have huge potential markets. We believe in diversity and equal opportunities and support unrepresented minorities. 50% of our portfolio companies have diverse teams and every third CEO. Invests in: Canada,USA,Austria,France,Germany,Poland,Spain,Sweden,Switzerland,UK,Israel First cheque: $100,000 - $300,000', null),
