  (2680, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'CofounderZone', 'Venture Fund', 'Pre-Seed, Seed, Series A', 'https://cofounder.zone/', 'We invest in companies that have a defined product and generate first revenues or are characterized by dynamically growing traction. We are sector agnostic. We put strong emphasis on creating added value within our portfolio companies by providing mentoring and substantive assistance of co-investing business angels from our network. We focus on start-ups that operate or plan to expand to Polish market.', '', '', '', '9 Prozna Street, Warsaw, Poland', 'Poland', 52.2297, 21.0122, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We invest in companies that have a defined product and generate first revenues or are characterized by dynamically growing traction. We are sector agnostic. We put strong emphasis on creating added value within our portfolio companies by providing mentoring and substantive assistance of co-investing business angels from our network. We focus on start-ups that operate or plan to expand to Polish market. Invests in: Poland,Germany,UK,France,Austria,Belgium,Bulgaria,Croatia,Cyprus,Czech Republic,Denmark,Estonia,Finland,Greece,Spain,Netherlands,Ireland,Lithuania,Luxembourg,Liechtenstein,Latvia,Switzerland,Norway,Malta,Portugal,Romania,Slovakia,Slovenia,Sweden,Hungary,Italy First cheque: $100,000 - $700,000', null),
