  (2686, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Colle Capital Partners', 'Venture Fund', 'Pre-Seed, Seed, Series A', 'https://colle.vc', 'We invest in Logistics, Healthcare and FinTech, but remain opportunistic in our approach. 

Colle Capital Partners is a global, opportunistic, early stage technology venture fund. Managers have completed deals in various verticals and across all capital structures. While we tend to gravitate towards Logistics, Healthcare and FinTech, we remain opportunistic in our approach. We pay special attention to data. Virtually all our deals have an intrinsic relationship with data as we believe the ability to isolate, utilize and act upon the best possible information is the foundation of success.

We prefer to step in early in the lifecycle of a company and help teams achieve their goals by assisting with all critical tasks that young startups require. We invest in people. Our mission is to identify and back teams that not only demonstrate intellect and passion but are also agile in their thinking and execution. We seek organizations that operate with a clear focus on sustainability in every dimension: business practices, unit economics and environmental impact.', '', '', '', '55 Hudson Yards, New York, NY 10001, United States', 'New York', 40.7128, -74.006, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We invest in Logistics, Healthcare and FinTech, but remain opportunistic in our approach. 

Colle Capital Partners is a global, opportunistic, early stage technology venture fund. Managers have completed deals in various verticals and across all capital structures. While we tend to gravitate towards Logistics, Healthcare and FinTech, we remain opportunistic in our approach. We pay special attention to data. Virtually all our deals have an intrinsic relationship with data as we believe the ability to isolate, utilize and act upon the best possible information is the foundation of success.

We prefer to step in early in the lifecycle of a company and help teams achieve their goals by assisting with all critical tasks that young startups require. We invest in people. Our mission is to identify and back teams that not only demonstrate intellect and passion but are also agile in their thinking and execution. We seek organizations that operate with a clear focus on sustainability in every dimension: business practices, unit economics and environmental impact. Invests in: USA,UK,France,Germany,Mexico,Colombia,Brazil,India,Algeria,Kenya,China,Japan First cheque: $500,000 - $2,000,000', null),
