  (2901, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Far Out Ventures', 'Venture Fund', 'Seed, Pre-Seed', 'https://www.farout.vc/', 'We invest in: 
-Venture Scale: clear potential to reach $100M+ revenue in 5-7 years
-Stage: Pre-Seed and Seed
-Business Model: Software (Marketplace, Enterprise & Vertical SaaS, FinTech)
-Sectors: B2B (or B2B2C Marketplaces)
-Geographies: United States, Canada, Latin America
-Check Size: $250-500K (Pre-Seed); $500-750K (Seed)
-Target Ownership: 5% at entry (2.5% minimum)
-Post-Money Valuation: $15M maximum at entry; <$10M strongly preferred
-Non-consensus: traditionally overlooked founders (background, geo, market)
-Lead: we don''t lead rounds in the traditional sense, but we often help structure and/or write the largest check in pre-seed rounds', '', '', '', '10 E Yanonali St, Santa Barbara, CA 93101, United States', 'United States', 39.8283, -98.5795, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We invest in: 
-Venture Scale: clear potential to reach $100M+ revenue in 5-7 years
-Stage: Pre-Seed and Seed
-Business Model: Software (Marketplace, Enterprise & Vertical SaaS, FinTech)
-Sectors: B2B (or B2B2C Marketplaces)
-Geographies: United States, Canada, Latin America
-Check Size: $250-500K (Pre-Seed); $500-750K (Seed)
-Target Ownership: 5% at entry (2.5% minimum)
-Post-Money Valuation: $15M maximum at entry; <$10M strongly preferred
-Non-consensus: traditionally overlooked founders (background, geo, market)
-Lead: we don''t lead rounds in the traditional sense, but we often help structure and/or write the largest check in pre-seed rounds Invests in: USA,Canada,Mexico,Brazil,Colombia First cheque: $200,000 - $500,000', null),
