  (2951, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Forster Chase Ventures', 'Incubator, Accelerator', 'Seed, Series A, Series B, Series C, Growth, 6. Pre-IPO', 'https://www.forsterchase.com/ventures-1', 'We invest in businesses with three things: the right strategy, capital and talent. As such we have put together an all-encompassing one-stop shop where businesses can be nurtured and fostered towards full maturity.

The type of businesses we would be keen to work with are similar to ours – agile, entrepreneurial and with a management team that is open to strategic advice from experienced industry C level executives and non-executives.
We also tend to work with capital intensive businesses within the Financial Services and Tech industries, particularly Insuretech, Fintech, Medtech and SAAS.

Unlike other business incubators or venture partners, we have a panel of extremely successful entrepreneurs and CEOs with a plethora of experience. When you work with us, you will be assigned one of the panel members to work with and they will both advise you on any specific processes such as fundraising, management buy-in and also become a board member.', '', '', '', 'Hamilton House,  1 Temple Avenue,  Blackfriars, EC4Y 0HA', 'Hamilton House', null, null, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We invest in businesses with three things: the right strategy, capital and talent. As such we have put together an all-encompassing one-stop shop where businesses can be nurtured and fostered towards full maturity.

The type of businesses we would be keen to work with are similar to ours – agile, entrepreneurial and with a management team that is open to strategic advice from experienced industry C level executives and non-executives.
We also tend to work with capital intensive businesses within the Financial Services and Tech industries, particularly Insuretech, Fintech, Medtech and SAAS.

Unlike other business incubators or venture partners, we have a panel of extremely successful entrepreneurs and CEOs with a plethora of experience. When you work with us, you will be assigned one of the panel members to work with and they will both advise you on any specific processes such as fundraising, management buy-in and also become a board member. Invests in: Afghanistan,Albania,Algeria,Andorra,Angola,Argentina,Antigua and Barbuda,Australia,Armenia,Austria,Azerbaijan,Bahamas,Bahrain,Bangladesh,Barbados,Belarus,Belize,Benin,Bhutan,Bolivia,Bosnia-H,Brazil,Brunei,Botswana,Burkina Faso,Bulgaria,Cabo Verde,Burundi,Cambodia,Belgium,Canada,Central African Republic,Chad,Chile,China,Cameroon,Colombia,Comoros,Costa Rica,Côte d''Ivoire,Croatia,Congo (Congo-Brazzaville),Cuba,Cyprus,Czech Republic,Denmark,Djibouti,DRC Congo,Dominica,Dominican Republic,Egypt,Ecuador,Equatorial Guinea,El Salvador,Eritrea,Estonia,Ethiopia,Fiji,Finland,"Eswatini (fmr. ""Swaziland"")",Gabon,Gambia,France,Germany,Georgia,Greece,Grenada,Ghana,Guinea,Guinea-Bissau,Guyana,Haiti,Guatemala,Holy See,Honduras,Hong Kong,Hungary,Iceland,India,Iran,Indonesia,Iraq,Ireland,Italy,Israel,Jamaica,Jordan,Japan,Kazakhstan,Kenya,Kuwait,Kiribati,Kyrgyzstan,Laos,Latvia,Lebanon,Liechtenstein,Liberia,Lesotho,Lithuania,Lybia,Luxembourg,Madagascar,Malawi,Maldives,Malaysia,Mali,Malta,Marshall Islands,Mauritania,Mauritius,Mexico,Micronesia,Moldova,Monaco,Mongolia,Montenegro,Morocco,Mozambique,Namibia,Myanmar,Nepal,Netherlands,New Zealand,Nicaragua,Niger,Nauru,North Korea,North Macedonia,Nigeria,Norway,Oman,Palau,Pakistan,Palestine,Panama,Papua New Guinea,Peru,Philippines,Paraguay,Portugal,Poland,Romania,Russia,Qatar,Rwanda,Saint Vincent and the Grenadines,Samoa,Sant Kitts and Nevis,Sant Lucia,San Marino,Saudi Arabia,Sao Tome and Principe,Serbia,Senegal,Sierra Leone,Seychelles,Singapore,Slovenia,Slovakia,Solomon Islands,South Africa,Somalia,South Korea,Spain,South Sudan,Sri Lanka,Sudan,Suriname,Switzerland,Sweden,Taiwan,