  (2970, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Francis Santora', 'Solo angel', 'Seed, Series A', 'https://tremendous.blog', 'I invest in companies like this:

- $200-500k revenue growing fast
- Huge market
- Great product
- Great founder

