  (3086, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Haatch', 'Venture Fund', 'Pre-Seed, Seed', 'https://haatch.com/', 'We invest in UK-based B2B SaaS pre-seed or seed stage start-ups. Haatch is industry-agnostic with a portfolio across applied AI, consumer, data infrastructure, edtech, fintech, future of work, healthtech, HRtech, media, product tools, proptech, retail-tech, sales enablement, and vertical SaaS. Our focus centres around evidence that the business is solving a deep pain or evidence of creating a massive impact for the customer alongside proof-of-value with a defined buyer.', '', '', '', 'The Hub, Blackfriars Street, Stamford, Lincolnshire, United Kingdom, PE9 2BW', 'The Hub', null, null, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We invest in UK-based B2B SaaS pre-seed or seed stage start-ups. Haatch is industry-agnostic with a portfolio across applied AI, consumer, data infrastructure, edtech, fintech, future of work, healthtech, HRtech, media, product tools, proptech, retail-tech, sales enablement, and vertical SaaS. Our focus centres around evidence that the business is solving a deep pain or evidence of creating a massive impact for the customer alongside proof-of-value with a defined buyer. Invests in: UK First cheque: $150,000 - $620,000', null),
