  (3172, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Industrifonden', 'Venture Fund', 'Seed', 'https://www.industrifonden.com/', 'We invest in three main areas: Deep Tech, Life Science, and Transformative Tech (primarily ventures with Swedish connection but also across Nordics):
 
Deep Tech
Science and emerging technologies that have the potential to fundamentally transform industries and societies. We focus on deep tech verticals like advanced materials, industry 4.0, energy, quantum computing, AI, synthetic biology, and more.
 
Life Science
We support the commercialisation of products and services, grounded in solid science, which convincingly address an unmet medical need, and where we also see a willingness to pay for innovation that makes a clinical difference. We have expertise, in particular, in biotech, medtech and healthtech.
 
Transformative Tech
Transformative Tech includes innovative business models and novel implementations of established technologies that enable industrial transformation and sustainable value creation. We are agnostic regarding industry verticals but stay within the B2B-space and look for founders with deep and credible insights within their focus area.', '', '', '', 'Vasagatan 11, Stockholm, 111 91, SE', 'Stockholm', 59.3293, 18.0686, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We invest in three main areas: Deep Tech, Life Science, and Transformative Tech (primarily ventures with Swedish connection but also across Nordics):
 
Deep Tech
Science and emerging technologies that have the potential to fundamentally transform industries and societies. We focus on deep tech verticals like advanced materials, industry 4.0, energy, quantum computing, AI, synthetic biology, and more.
 
Life Science
We support the commercialisation of products and services, grounded in solid science, which convincingly address an unmet medical need, and where we also see a willingness to pay for innovation that makes a clinical difference. We have expertise, in particular, in biotech, medtech and healthtech.
 
Transformative Tech
Transformative Tech includes innovative business models and novel implementations of established technologies that enable industrial transformation and sustainable value creation. We are agnostic regarding industry verticals but stay within the B2B-space and look for founders with deep and credible insights within their focus area. Invests in: Sweden,Denmark,Norway,Finland First cheque: $1,000,000 - $5,000,000', null),
