  (3181, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Innopact', 'Venture Fund', 'Pre-Seed, Seed, Series A', 'https://www.innopact.vc/', 'We invest in audacious entrepreneurs driving high-impact technology innovation across emerging markets. 

