  (3274, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Kalei Ventures', 'Venture Fund', 'Pre-Seed, Seed, Series A', 'https://www.kaleiventures.com/', 'We invest in sectors where Latin America can create global leaders. These sectors include software development applications (e.g. marketplaces, consumer internet, fintech, edtech) and sectors that benefit greatly from new trends such as artificial intelligence and the internet of things (e.g. healthtech, agtech, logistics).

