  (3421, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Mätch VC', 'Venture Fund', 'Pre-Seed, Seed', 'https://www.maetch.vc/', 'We invest in early-stage B2B startups that solve highly technical challenges and/or address social issues that fit our network.

