  (3653, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Pegasus Angel Accelerator', 'Angel Network', 'Seed', 'https://www.pegasusangelaccelerator.com', 'We invest in visionary founders tackling high-growth markets with innovative solutions that disrupt traditional industries. We prioritize teams with deep market insights, strong technical expertise, and a clear path to product-market fit, aiming to support them in the critical early stages to build scalable, defensible businesses with long-term impact. We offer $100,000 in investment up to a valuation cap up to $3.5M', '', '', '', 'Santa Monica, CA', 'Santa Monica', 34.0195, -118.4912, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We invest in visionary founders tackling high-growth markets with innovative solutions that disrupt traditional industries. We prioritize teams with deep market insights, strong technical expertise, and a clear path to product-market fit, aiming to support them in the critical early stages to build scalable, defensible businesses with long-term impact. We offer $100,000 in investment up to a valuation cap up to $3.5M Invests in: USA First cheque: $100,000 - $100,000', null),
