  (3731, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Quam Venture Capital', 'Venture Fund', 'Pre-Seed, Series B, Series C, Growth, Series A, Seed', 'https://www.quamvc.com/', 'We invest in Artificial Intelligence, Space Ventures, Clean-tech Renewable Energy, Biotechnology, Blockchain, Cybersecurity, Digital Ledger Technologies, STEMCELL, Nano Technologies, Quantum Computing, Sophisticated SMART proprietary technologies, VR Entertainment, Transportation, and Infrastructure across Europe, North America, and Latin America.

Our investment spectrum is wide-ranging, from as little as €500,000 to support innovative concepts to as much as €3 million for teams with early revenue traction in need of expansion capital, spanning Seed, Series A, and beyond.

However, our commitment doesn''t end there. As our portfolio companies progress and demonstrate their potential, we stand ready to provide additional funding, scaling up our investments to around €10 million. In extraordinary cases, we may consider even larger investments when opportunities have the potential to reshape or dominate entire industries.

We seek investment opportunities that address substantial challenges within expansive markets, spanning various sectors.', '', '', '', 'The Shard, 24/25 Floor, 32 London Bridge Street, London, SE1 9SG, United Kingdom.', 'London', 51.5072, -0.1276, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We invest in Artificial Intelligence, Space Ventures, Clean-tech Renewable Energy, Biotechnology, Blockchain, Cybersecurity, Digital Ledger Technologies, STEMCELL, Nano Technologies, Quantum Computing, Sophisticated SMART proprietary technologies, VR Entertainment, Transportation, and Infrastructure across Europe, North America, and Latin America.

Our investment spectrum is wide-ranging, from as little as €500,000 to support innovative concepts to as much as €3 million for teams with early revenue traction in need of expansion capital, spanning Seed, Series A, and beyond.

However, our commitment doesn''t end there. As our portfolio companies progress and demonstrate their potential, we stand ready to provide additional funding, scaling up our investments to around €10 million. In extraordinary cases, we may consider even larger investments when opportunities have the potential to reshape or dominate entire industries.

We seek investment opportunities that address substantial challenges within expansive markets, spanning various sectors. Invests in: UK,USA,Australia,Brazil,Belgium,Canada,Central African Republic,Czech Republic,Denmark,Ukraine,Switzerland,Sweden,Spain,South Africa,Slovakia,Singapore,Saudi Arabia,Portugal,Poland,Norway,New Zealand,Netherlands,Monaco,Mexico,Malta,Mauritius,Maldives,Luxembourg,Italy,Ireland,Hong Kong,Greece,Germany,France,Finland,Croatia,Austria First cheque: $500,000 - $10,000,000', null),
