  (3876, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Seed4Tech Venture Capital', 'Venture Fund', 'Seed, Pre-Seed', 'http://www.seed4tech.de/', 'We invest in deeptech, infrastructure, industry, health. 

