  (4116, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Tremis Capital', 'Angel Network', 'Pre-Seed, Seed, Series A, Series B, Series C, Growth', 'https://www.tremis.in/', 'We invest in fintech, web3, SaaS, blockchain, gaming, health tech, enterprise tech, consumer internet, marketplaces with 50k to 5 Mn ARR. We prefer to never lead a round, and co-invest with the lead investor on similar round terms.', '', '', '', 'N138, Panchsheek Park, New Delhi', 'Delhi', 28.6139, 77.209, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We invest in fintech, web3, SaaS, blockchain, gaming, health tech, enterprise tech, consumer internet, marketplaces with 50k to 5 Mn ARR. We prefer to never lead a round, and co-invest with the lead investor on similar round terms. Invests in: Nigeria,Brazil,USA,India,Singapore,UAE First cheque: $50,000 - $200,000', null),
