  (4122, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'Troy Billett', 'Solo angel', 'Pre-Seed, Seed', 'https://www.troybillett.com/', 'I invest in new technologies enabling others to reach financial success. With a focus on early stage social enterprises, investments are made before Series A. In-kind support may include guidance on fundraising with a social mission. Investments are focused on opportunities that grow exponentially.', '', '', '', 'Dallas, TX', 'Dallas', 32.7767, -96.797, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'I invest in new technologies enabling others to reach financial success. With a focus on early stage social enterprises, investments are made before Series A. In-kind support may include guidance on fundraising with a social mission. Investments are focused on opportunities that grow exponentially. Invests in: USA,UK First cheque: $10,000 - $100,000', null),
