  (4124, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'True Altitude', 'Angel Network', 'Seed, Series A, Series B, Series C, Growth', 'https://www.truealtitude.com/', 'We invest in European & Asian from Seed to Series B. Specifically in Fintech, B2B SaaS and E-Commerce', '', '', '', '44 Great Cumberland Place, London, GB', 'London', 51.5072, -0.1276, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We invest in European & Asian from Seed to Series B. Specifically in Fintech, B2B SaaS and E-Commerce Invests in: Australia,UK,Singapore First cheque: $50,000 - $20,000,000', null),
  (4125, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'True Growth Capital', 'Angel Network', 'Pre-Seed, Seed, Series A, Series B, Series C, Growth, 6. Pre-IPO', 'https://truegrowth.de/', 'We invest in digital platforms, d2c, network models, software, social media, a bit of Saas. 

Our investment hypothesis centers around finding the best people working on commercially sound business models. This philosophy of not just singularly optimizing on growth metrics but considering long-term viability of the business while still achieving digital category leadership within a c. 5-8 year timeframe, is what we call “True Growth”. 

Furthermore, we focus our investments on cases where it is evident that we can provide “smart money”. I.e. opportunities where the competencies of our group are strongly relevant to get the company on a true, sustained, commercial growth trajectory. We leverage key learnings from scaling our own ventures (everyone in our group is an operator!) to global importance while retaining robust unit economics in order to pick investments and support our portfolio founders.', '', '', '', 'Schönhauser Allee 53, 10437 Berlin', 'Berlin', 52.52, 13.405, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We invest in digital platforms, d2c, network models, software, social media, a bit of Saas. 

Our investment hypothesis centers around finding the best people working on commercially sound business models. This philosophy of not just singularly optimizing on growth metrics but considering long-term viability of the business while still achieving digital category leadership within a c. 5-8 year timeframe, is what we call “True Growth”. 

Furthermore, we focus our investments on cases where it is evident that we can provide “smart money”. I.e. opportunities where the competencies of our group are strongly relevant to get the company on a true, sustained, commercial growth trajectory. We leverage key learnings from scaling our own ventures (everyone in our group is an operator!) to global importance while retaining robust unit economics in order to pick investments and support our portfolio founders. Invests in: Germany,UK,Austria,Switzerland,Netherlands,Spain,Belgium,Luxembourg,France,Portugal,Denmark,Sweden,Finland First cheque: $50,000 - $1,000,000', null),
  (4126, 'Oct 2025 - OpenVC.xlsx', 'TruePNL', 'Other', 'Series A, Seed, Series B, Series C, Growth', 'https://truepnl.com/', 'We invest in early-stage crypto projects.

TruePNL develops high-end, yet not overloaded financial products aimed to deliver transparency and convenience in terms of investing & trading crypto.

TruePNL Launchpad, as the main product of TruePNL, is designed as a fair and secure investment application, providing a bridge between the outstanding projects, looking for a flexible and robust launching platform, and investors, seeking opportunities to become a part of the up-and-coming projects by participating in the clear and reliable token sale process.
TruePNL focuses on launching play-to-earn gaming projects, NFT-driven platforms, DeFi protocols and ecosystems.', '', '', '', 'PNL Technologies PTE LTD 202112999G 10 Anson Road #20-05 International Plaza Singapore (079903)', 'Singapore', 1.3521, 103.8198, '', '', '', 0, 0, 'We invest in early-stage crypto projects.

TruePNL develops high-end, yet not overloaded financial products aimed to deliver transparency and convenience in terms of investing & trading crypto.

TruePNL Launchpad, as the main product of TruePNL, is designed as a fair and secure investment application, providing a bridge between the outstanding projects, looking for a flexible and robust launching platform, and investors, seeking opportunities to become a part of the up-and-coming projects by participating in the clear and reliable token sale process.
TruePNL focuses on launching play-to-earn gaming projects, NFT-driven platforms, DeFi protocols and ecosystems. Invests in: Austria,Albania,Andorra,Belarus,Belgium,Bulgaria,Bosnia-H,UK,Hungary,Germany,Greece,Denmark,Ireland,Iceland,Spain,Italy,Latvia,Lithuania,Liechtenstein,Luxembourg,Malta,Moldova,Monaco,Netherlands,Norway,Poland,Portugal,Russia,Romania,North Macedonia,Serbia,Slovakia,Slovenia,Ukraine,Finland,France,Croatia,Montenegro,Czech Republic,Switzerland,Sweden,Estonia First cheque: $10,000 - $600,000', null),
